KZ3 patch 2211 (RSX pass 175): fence waits by call site and the [perf-split-w] line (RSX_PERF=1 + RSX_PERF_SPLIT=1; a counter, default behaviour unchanged).

rsx_wait_split.h (pure) names the walker's fence waits: wbdrain (ld_wbd_wait, LD_WB_DEFER drains), pslot (present path slot N-1), ring (descriptor/PS-constant ring wrap), idle, resize, verify, flush_rb, flush_other. ld_wait_fence_s wraps ld_wait_fence and the ld_flush wait adds to RSX_PERF_WS_*; cellGcmSys.c prints one [perf-split-w] line per window after [perf-split-o]: ms/flip and waits/flip per site, wait_other/rbwait buckets, gap (sites minus those buckets), unwait (other minus wait_other), gpuwait and wb_sync side by side (wb_sync contains the drain's fence wait: one wait, four counters), named/rest/sum/walk/diff, gpu= (poller wall per list) and lists/flip. Host test tools/smoke/test_wait_split.sh. NOT built or run in the game.

